### ==========================================

### CREATE CLASS

### ==========================================

### POST /schools/:schoolId/classes

POST {{baseUrl}}/schools/{{schoolId}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "className": "Grade 6",
  "capacity": 40,
  "level": "Primary",
  "stream": "A"
}

