### GET ALL CLASSES FOR SCHOOL

### ==========================================

### GET /schools/:schoolId/classes

GET {{baseUrl}}/schools/{{schoolId}}/classes

### ==========================================

### GET ONE CLASS

### ==========================================

### GET /schools/:schoolId/classes/:classId

GET {{baseUrl}}/schools/{{schoolId}}/classes/{{classId}}

### ==========================================

### UPDATE CLASS

### ==========================================

### PATCH /schools/:schoolId/classes/:classId

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/schools/{{schoolId}}/classes/{{classId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "className": "Grade 6",
  "capacity": 45,
  "level": "grade 6",
  "stream": "A"
}

